WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.730
- I can't eat any bread?

00:00:01.730 --> 00:00:03.259
- Oh!

00:00:03.259 --> 00:00:04.676
- Now I'm scared.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:07.943
- Hey, guys.

00:00:07.943 --> 00:00:08.776
I'm Jasmine.

00:00:08.776 --> 00:00:09.609
- Hey, I'm Katie.

00:00:09.609 --> 00:00:10.442
- And I'm Kelly.

00:00:10.442 --> 00:00:12.452
- I don't really know what
a food sensitivity test is.

00:00:12.452 --> 00:00:14.866
- My first thought is that
it's a test for food allergies.

00:00:14.866 --> 00:00:17.456
- I've been wanting to take
one for a really long time,

00:00:17.456 --> 00:00:18.957
and I'm super excited.

00:00:18.957 --> 00:00:20.538
According to Everlywell's website,

00:00:20.538 --> 00:00:22.493
their food sensitivity
test checks your body's

00:00:22.493 --> 00:00:24.834
immune response to 108 foods.

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:26.816
These food sensitivities
could potentially bring you

00:00:26.816 --> 00:00:28.546
discomfort, stomach issues, fatigue,

00:00:28.546 --> 00:00:30.380
or varying other symptoms.

00:00:30.380 --> 00:00:31.970
It is not a food allergy test.

00:00:31.970 --> 00:00:34.338
The results of the test serve
as a guide to help personalize

00:00:34.338 --> 00:00:36.550
a two-phase elimination diet.

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:38.229
This is meant to help remove
a lot of the guesswork

00:00:38.229 --> 00:00:39.222
in the process.

00:00:39.222 --> 00:00:41.231
So I do think I have food sensitivities.

00:00:41.231 --> 00:00:43.363
Since I have experimented
with diets before,

00:00:43.363 --> 00:00:45.850
I think I have an intolerance to dairy

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:46.889
and definitely gluten.

00:00:46.889 --> 00:00:49.697
- I've always wondered if
I'm sensitive to gluten.

00:00:49.697 --> 00:00:50.977
I've taken it out before

00:00:50.977 --> 00:00:53.650
because I have an autoimmune
disease called Hashimoto's,

00:00:53.650 --> 00:00:55.584
and I've met a few people that have said

00:00:55.584 --> 00:00:58.678
when they've eliminated gluten,
their Hashimoto's, like,

00:00:58.678 --> 00:00:59.511
went away.

00:00:59.511 --> 00:01:03.511
- I think I have a food
sensitivity to soy milk.

00:01:05.454 --> 00:01:09.266
I am interested to see if
I'm sensitive to dairy.

00:01:09.266 --> 00:01:13.815
I usually tell people that I'm
blessed because 95% of Asians

00:01:13.815 --> 00:01:15.375
are lactose intolerant.

00:01:15.375 --> 00:01:18.783
I also think I am sensitive to gluten.

00:01:18.783 --> 00:01:20.295
I've been told many times that I am,

00:01:20.295 --> 00:01:21.895
I've never gotten a test for it.

00:01:21.895 --> 00:01:23.493
One time I had really bad back pain.

00:01:23.493 --> 00:01:26.143
I went to the doctor and I was
like, yeah, it hurts so bad.

00:01:26.143 --> 00:01:27.052
And she looks at my arm.

00:01:27.052 --> 00:01:28.455
She's like, "Do you have eczema?"

00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:29.815
And I was like, "Yeah, I do."

00:01:29.815 --> 00:01:31.867
She was like, "You should
cut down on gluten."

00:01:31.867 --> 00:01:33.478
And I was like, "But my back hurts."

00:01:33.478 --> 00:01:35.938
- I do not want to be sensitive to cheese.

00:01:35.938 --> 00:01:37.188
Cheese, cheese.

00:01:38.412 --> 00:01:39.362
- Dairy.

00:01:39.362 --> 00:01:41.354
- I'm a little skeptical about this test,

00:01:41.354 --> 00:01:43.588
but I wonder if it's going
to be, like, super accurate.

00:01:43.588 --> 00:01:45.181
- I'm skeptical,

00:01:45.181 --> 00:01:46.918
not because I don't believe it,

00:01:46.918 --> 00:01:49.598
but I, like, just kind
of don't believe it.

00:01:49.598 --> 00:01:50.622
- Just gotta be somewhat accurate.

00:01:50.622 --> 00:01:51.455
I don't know.

00:01:51.455 --> 00:01:52.288
- [Director] Well, are you
excited to take the test?

00:01:52.288 --> 00:01:56.205
- I'm excited. Let's find
out what I can't eat.

00:01:57.419 --> 00:01:58.746
Okay, instructions.

00:01:58.746 --> 00:02:00.852
Step one, watch video.

00:02:00.852 --> 00:02:03.965
So I guess I'm going to do that first.

00:02:03.965 --> 00:02:04.798
Just watched the video,

00:02:04.798 --> 00:02:06.561
and I think I know what I need to do.

00:02:06.561 --> 00:02:08.181
- Drink a large glass of water,

00:02:08.181 --> 00:02:11.082
warm hands with hot water
for at least one minute,

00:02:11.082 --> 00:02:14.221
shake your hands by your
side for 15 to 20 seconds,

00:02:14.221 --> 00:02:16.932
and do some jumping jacks
to get extra warmed up.

00:02:16.932 --> 00:02:18.332
- Time to prick my finger.

00:02:18.332 --> 00:02:19.657
- I've never pricked my finger.

00:02:19.657 --> 00:02:21.965
So we'll see how that goes.

00:02:21.965 --> 00:02:23.048
- Ahh!

00:02:23.048 --> 00:02:24.409
- Okay, it's not that bad.

00:02:24.409 --> 00:02:25.826
- Now I'm scared.

00:02:28.069 --> 00:02:30.788
- So now I'm just going to
drip my blood into the circles.

00:02:30.788 --> 00:02:33.103
- I have to fill ten
circles with my blood.

00:02:33.103 --> 00:02:33.936
- This is my test.

00:02:33.936 --> 00:02:34.953
All good.

00:02:34.953 --> 00:02:36.388
I'm gonna package this guy up.

00:02:36.388 --> 00:02:38.956
- And mail it back to Everlywell.

00:02:38.956 --> 00:02:41.414
- Very interested to see
how this can tell you

00:02:41.414 --> 00:02:42.717
your food sensitivities.

00:02:42.717 --> 00:02:43.903
- [Jasmine] I just got a text.

00:02:43.903 --> 00:02:45.490
- The email from Everlywell has come in.

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:47.043
It says my results are ready.

00:02:47.043 --> 00:02:48.952
So I guess this is just
the moment of truth.

00:02:48.952 --> 00:02:50.880
It's gonna determine how
happy or sad I'm going to be.

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:52.294
I guess for the next week.

00:02:52.294 --> 00:02:53.995
- Today is my birthday.

00:02:53.995 --> 00:02:55.721
And I'm really hoping there's
not something on there

00:02:55.721 --> 00:02:56.863
that's going to ruin the day.

00:02:56.863 --> 00:02:57.696
- Three.

00:02:57.696 --> 00:02:58.529
- Two.

00:02:58.529 --> 00:02:59.362
- One!

00:02:59.362 --> 00:03:01.277
- And I don't know my email.

00:03:01.277 --> 00:03:02.110
- Hi, Jasmine.

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.660
Your food sensitivity
comprehensive test is complete.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:09.660
Your test showed an IgG reactivity
above normal to 46 foods.

00:03:10.487 --> 00:03:15.433
- You have an IgG reactive
above normal to 49 foods.

00:03:15.433 --> 00:03:16.641
- Oh my God.

00:03:16.641 --> 00:03:21.324
I don't have any high reactivity
to any foods or moderate.

00:03:21.324 --> 00:03:25.048
- You didn't show high
reactivity to any foods.

00:03:25.048 --> 00:03:27.298
Oh, I have high reactivity.

00:03:28.133 --> 00:03:29.130
Egg whites?

00:03:29.130 --> 00:03:30.867
Egg whites are a high reactivity?

00:03:30.867 --> 00:03:33.477
- Moderate reactivity to seven foods.

00:03:33.477 --> 00:03:34.310
Milk.

00:03:35.819 --> 00:03:36.652
Egg white.

00:03:36.652 --> 00:03:37.485
Gluten.

00:03:37.485 --> 00:03:39.718
Pineapple, spelt, vanilla, and wheat.

00:03:39.718 --> 00:03:40.551
Vanilla?

00:03:40.551 --> 00:03:43.865
- Cashew, cow's milk, emmental cheese?

00:03:43.865 --> 00:03:45.064
I don't even know if I said that right.

00:03:45.064 --> 00:03:46.395
Often called Swiss cheese.

00:03:46.395 --> 00:03:48.042
Oh, I love Swiss cheese.

00:03:48.042 --> 00:03:48.958
Blue cheese?

00:03:48.958 --> 00:03:53.478
Gluten, goat milk, pistachio,
rye, smelt, wheat, whey.

00:03:53.478 --> 00:03:55.165
I can't eat any bread?

00:03:55.165 --> 00:03:57.146
- Okay, let's see what my mild.

00:03:57.146 --> 00:04:00.245
Asparagus, which is something we eat

00:04:00.245 --> 00:04:01.503
a couple of times a week.

00:04:01.503 --> 00:04:05.920
Bell pepper, black tea,
Brazil nut, cayenne, chicken?

00:04:06.939 --> 00:04:08.656
That's like 50% of my diet.

00:04:08.656 --> 00:04:09.644
- Asparagus, butter?

00:04:09.644 --> 00:04:10.477
Butter?

00:04:10.477 --> 00:04:11.504
- Butter?

00:04:11.504 --> 00:04:12.595
- Casein?

00:04:12.595 --> 00:04:13.428
- Casein?

00:04:13.428 --> 00:04:15.831
- [Both] Casein is a protein,
a major component of milk.

00:04:15.831 --> 00:04:17.382
- Okay, so they just don't want me having

00:04:17.382 --> 00:04:18.926
