in that I can't have

00:04:29.824 --> 00:04:32.074
chicken, salmon, or turkey
throughout the week.

00:04:32.074 --> 00:04:33.670
That's literally all we eat.

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:35.288
So I'm going to have
to get really creative.

00:04:35.288 --> 00:04:38.288
- That's a lot of foods I eat often.

00:04:41.108 --> 00:04:43.333
- I wonder if my autoimmune disease, like,

00:04:43.333 --> 00:04:46.773
had anything to do with
like me having so many.

00:04:46.773 --> 00:04:48.530
- This totally ruined my birthday.

00:04:48.530 --> 00:04:50.058
I'm so bummed, but the good news is

00:04:50.058 --> 00:04:52.058
