00:05:14.261 --> 00:05:17.812
Everything has garlic
or ginger or something.

00:05:17.812 --> 00:05:19.151
I'm just going to check out.

00:05:19.151 --> 00:05:20.281
- All right, I'm at the store,

00:05:20.281 --> 00:05:23.190
